1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,800
Night six. The wind comes up. A board
on the north window tears off, and the
whole wall breathes.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:12,400
Around midnight something walks across
the porch. Slow. Heavy. Every one of
us holds our breath, even me.

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:16,733
It's a fox. It's only a fox. I'm
calling him Boots. He has one white
foot.
